      "narrative": "I entered the galley, scooping up a kettle that lay abandoned on the floor. As I ventured north, I found myself in a sparse store room, the air heavy with the scent of paraffin. Here, I discovered a coil of rope and a brass key, both of which I pocketed. Moving further north, I stumbled into a cluttered workshop, managing to snag an oil can from the floor. Despite the empty shelves and scattered tools, I found what I was looking for. I unable to open or close the kettle, but it was nonetheless an intriguing addition to my collection. Now, I'm back in the store, planning my next move in this mysterious vessel.",
